        },
        "value": "13.38",
        "unit": "percent"
      }
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "C4",
      "text": "Despite overall gross margin growth, the gross margin percentage for PRODUCT_10 (reported as cloud gross margin) decreased to 69% in fiscal year 2025 due to the impact of scaling AI infrastructure, partially offset by efficiency gains in PRODUCT_11 (Item 7, EP_0002_E02).",
